- A+B = B+A

2. relationshipExists(playerA, playerB)
- Checks if couple data exists

3. createRelationship(playerA, playerB)
- Initializes relationship variables

4. getRelationshipStage(playerA, playerB)
- Returns current relationship stage

5. addRelationshipPoints(playerA, playerB, amount)
- Adds couple progression points

6. updateRelationshipStage(coupleID)
- Updates stage automatically by points

